                "kind": "rich",
                "value": "<div class=\"card\" data-accent=\"amber\">\n  <div class=\"card-head\"><h3 class=\"card-kicker\">5.0 Methodological Rigor &amp; Epistemic Survival</h3><span class=\"tag\">Methodology</span></div>\n  <h3 style=\"margin:6px 0 12px; font-size:clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 28px);\">Making Imagination a Testable Reality</h3>\n  <p>A proposition that cannot fail is an argument with reality, not an inquiry into what is real. Notes &amp; Methods establishes the uncompromising epistemic standards by which every concept in Science Coherence is evaluated:</p>\n  <div class=\"formula\">$$\\text{Validity} = f(\\text{Empirical Survival} \\mid \\text{Stated Failure Boundaries})$$</div>\n  <blockquote class=\"drawer-quote\" style=\"margin:16px 0; padding-left:16px; border-left:3px solid var(--amber); font-family:var(--serif); font-size:17px; font-style:italic;\">“Imagination is not a hypothesis waiting for human consensus; it is a generative vector that must state where it breaks, run in reality, and survive.”</blockquote>\n  <ul class=\"list\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <li><strong>Stating What is Varied Up Front.</strong> Every experiment and theoretical proposition declares its exact parameters, perturbation scales, and intervention windows before execution.</li>\n    <li><strong>Stating What is Watched.</strong> Invariant metrics of coherence: spectral stationarity, recovery rate under stress, phase locking across scales, and absence of dissipative drift.</li>\n    <li><strong>Stating What Counts as Failure.</strong> True falsifiability: declaring the exact observations that would definitively prove the hypothesis wrong. A record of only survivals is an uninformative half-truth.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"sub-head\">Multi-Disciplinary Reading Entryways</h3>\n<div class=\"card-grid cols-3 inner\">\n  <div class=\"mini\" data-accent=\"blue\">\n    <h4>For the Theoretical Physicist</h4>\n    <p>Enter through non-equilibrium thermodynamics, vacuum birefringence, boundary operators, and time-crystalline phase locking.</p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:12px\"><a class=\"button dark mini-btn\" href=\"#/research/framework\">Explore Framework ↗</a></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mini\" data-accent=\"teal\">\n    <h4>For the Biologist &amp; Clinician</h4>\n    <p>Enter through chromatin compaction ($H3K9me3$), interfacial exclusion-zone water dynamics, and metabolic circadian entrainment.</p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:12px\"><a class=\"button dark mini-btn\" href=\"#/research/biophysic\">Explore Biophysics ↗</a></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mini\" data-accent=\"violet\">\n    <h4>For the Philosopher &amp; Inquirer</h4>\n    <p>Enter through first-person ontology, the collapse of the detached spectator, and participating consciousness.</p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:12px\"><a class=\"button dark mini-btn\" href=\"#/research/philosophy\">Explore Philosophy ↗</a></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\" data-accent=\"teal\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">\n  <div class=\"card-head\"><h3 class=\"card-kicker\">5.1 Empirical Grounding in The Lab</h3><span class=\"tag\">The Lab</span></div>\n  <p>Where propositions stop being argued and start being run. The Lab provides the experimental apparatus and live data recordings where variations are introduced, stationarity is tracked, and failures are logged transparently.</p>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n    <a class=\"button dark mini-btn\" href=\"#/lab\">Open The Lab ↗</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"callout\" data-accent=\"rose\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">\n  <h3 class=\"card-kicker\">5.2 The Unified Body of Work</h3>\n  <p>One inquiry, many ways in. Framework, Philosophy, Meta-Mathematics, Biophysics, Protocol, and Lab are not isolated academic silos. They are coordinated projections of a single coherent inquiry into the nature of reality and living order.</p>\n</div>"
