                "key": "c0.body",
                "group": "00 · Always becoming",
                "label": "Process inside paragraph",
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "There is no first moment standing apart from the rest, and no observer waiting there to record it. There is only where you are — already inside the process, which is exactly where it can be entered."
