                "group": "01 · Before anything is measured",
                "label": "Participation paragraph",
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "And there is nowhere to stand outside it. Whoever observes the world is produced by the same process as the world observed. No detached vantage point, no external tribunal — only participation."
